{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You just got done working a late shift. You then go to the exit to go to your car. But when you open the door, your right back to the same office you just left in. On top of that, you don't feel so alone in this office anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective of the game is to explore the office and find a key to leave the office room that you are in. But you have to be carful, the monster is always nearby. The office will change very subtly every time you go through it again. Find the key and break this strange loop that you are in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ritual is going to start. Are you going to join it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553580?t=1741289582","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553580?t=1741289582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553580/aa75e489496fff2f1cd5162e4315c3e7f35ffe9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741289582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553580/aa75e489496fff2f1cd5162e4315c3e7f35ffe9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741289582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is cursing in the games text and the monster is somewhat nude."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You just got done working a late shift. You then go to the exit to go to your car. But when you open the door, your right back to the same office you just left in. On top of that, you don't feel so alone in this office anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective of the game is to explore the office and find a key to leave the office room that you are in. But you have to be carful, the monster is always nearby. The office will change very subtly every time you go through it again. Find the key and break this strange loop that you are in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ritual is going to start. Are you going to join it?</p>","developers":["Brian Benitez"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553580/header.jpg?t=1741289582","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Ritual","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) I5-9300h CPU @2.40GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> It can go lower, I don't have a lot of systems to try it on.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Brian Benitez"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nNudez\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Derbe Sprache\n\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553580/1486299d640431749e466f6ab691f1cfffceef04/ss_1486299d640431749e466f6ab691f1cfffceef04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741289582","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553580/1486299d640431749e466f6ab691f1cfffceef04/ss_1486299d640431749e466f6ab691f1cfffceef04.600x338.jpg?t=1741289582"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a